msgid ""
"📨 Request sent. %1$s decides whether you take over their task: %2$s at %3$s, %4$s.\n"
"\n"
"They have until %5$s to answer. If they do not answer by then, they keep the task."
msgstr ""
"📨 Demande envoyée. %1$s décide si tu reprends sa tâche : %2$s à %3$s, %4$s.\n"
"\n"
"La personne a jusqu’à %5$s pour répondre. Sans réponse d’ici là, elle garde la tâche."

